  NodeID: DragonSeductionReport
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"Both Mist Da Wizard and the Village elder were surprised when they
    found out you had somehow seduced the dragon, and on top of that you had somehow
    kept the town safe in the process. Both of them approved of the method, albeit
    it was rather unconventional. Now you just had to figure out how to explain this
    to your mother."'
